        "license_policy_uri": "https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Warcraft_Wiki:Copyrights",
        "changes": "Selected names and geographic relationships; no maps, narrative, coordinates or game assets copied.",
        "review_sha256": "2ce16805dc6867a2c15e8ca39e10a0110145752991f9c9bf8cda3554c790dab9",
        "reviewed_claims": [
          "The shared article explicitly marks its subject as remaining in Classic and Forever.",
          "Its named subregions include: Bathran's Haunt, Iris Lake, Lake Falathim, Mystral Lake, Silverwind Refuge, Raynewood Retreat, The Ruins of Stardust, The Shrine of Aessina, Thistlefur Village, Greenpaw Village, Felfire Hill, Fire Scar Shrine, Warsong Lumber Camp, Warsong Labor Camp, The Dor'Danil Barrow Den, Satyrnaar, Night Run, Xavian, Falfarren River, The Talondeep Path.",
          "Ashenvale adjoins Darkshore, Felwood, Azshara, Stonetalon Mountains and The Barrens in Kalimdor."
        ],
        "redistribution": "Selected adaptation under CC-BY-SA-4.0; underlying Blizzard rights not licensed by this notice."
      }
    }
